WEBVTT

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:31.331
In fact, unions do a lot of good

00:10:31.355 --> 00:10:35.116
and have been good
for the digital media industry.

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:38.816
So I regret that.

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:41.646
AG: Leah was just being
her authentic self.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:44.576
It felt good in the moment, but over time,

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:47.026
the reactions from
other people got to her.

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:49.047
LF: Well, I was angry a lot of the time

00:10:49.071 --> 00:10:50.880
because I didn't understand why ...

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:55.311
people didn't accept me as I was,

00:10:55.335 --> 00:10:57.566
online and in real life.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:01.336
AG: That's when she got
a tip: be less authentic.